OL,3,APrince and Princess of Wales share a
OL,4,Alaugh with Tom Cruise at film premiere
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales
OL,7,Frenewed their friendship with Tom
OL,8,FCruise at the premiere of the Hollywood
OL,9,Fstar's latest film in London on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FCruise took the hand of Catherine,
OL,13,FPrincess of Wales, as they talked and
OL,14,Flaughed on a black carpet - instead of
OL,15,Fthe traditional red - before the royal
OL,16,Fgala screening of Digger in Leicester
OL,17,FSquare.
OL,19,FCruise has known the prince and
OL,20,Fprincess for a number of years and also
OL,21,Fmet William's mother, Princess Diana,
OL,22,Fand attended her funeral in 1997.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
