OL,3,APrince and Princess of Wales share a
OL,4,Alaugh with Tom Cruise at film premiere
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine wore a pair of Diana's pearl
OL,7,Fdrop earrings to the premiere on
OL,8,FTuesday, as well as the late Queen
OL,9,FMother's amethyst sautoir necklace.
